@local/retro-dock README · 兼容：- 平台：web（Chromium 内核）。
- 宿主：`dsh >= 0.2.0-rc.1 < 0.3.0`；当前在 `0.2.1-rc.3` 上验证。
- 已知限制：`sessionStats` 缺失时无法校准；页面文本回退不如宿主投影可信。

@local/retro-dock README · Install：```bash
npm pack   # local-retro-dock-1.7.0.tgz
```

@local/retro-dock README · Compatibility：- Platform: web (Chromium).
- Host: `dsh >= 0.2.0-rc.1 < 0.3.0`; verified on `0.2.1-rc.3`.
- Known limits: without `sessionStats` there is no calibration; the page-text fallback is less trustworthy than host projections.
